WEBVTT

asr-000001
01:11:23.310 --> 01:11:25.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair,

asr-000001-split-2
01:11:25.020 --> 01:11:28.610
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Deputy Minority Leader Cendaña, you are recognized.

asr-000002
01:11:29.950 --> 01:11:35.670
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa totoo lamang po, kasama po ako dun sa second round dapat ng pagtatanong from the minority.

asr-000003
01:11:35.970 --> 01:11:42.370
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So ako po yung una, pero after I think around 29 members of the majority.

asr-000004
01:11:43.050 --> 01:11:49.770
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ganyan po yung karami ng mga members of the House na gusto po magbigay ng input, magtanong sa DOH.

asr-000005
01:11:49.770 --> 01:11:55.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi gusto po natin tiyakin yung tagumpay of the DOH under the leadership of Secretary Mercado

asr-000006
01:11:55.510 --> 01:12:02.550
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and of course the success of the PhilHealth under the leadership of President-CEO Beverly Ho.

asr-000007
01:12:03.230 --> 01:12:13.230
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakalaga po sa amin na magtagumpay ang inyong leadership, not because lang para lang sa administrasyon, kundi para po sa sambayan ng Pilipino.

asr-000008
01:12:13.230 --> 01:12:19.750
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya po, with the indulgence of the members of the House who have expressed,

asr-000009
01:12:19.770 --> 01:12:25.710
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: their intent to raise questions and issues to the Secretary of the Department of Health,

asr-000010
01:12:25.850 --> 01:12:31.690
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I move to suspend consideration of the proposed budget of the Department of Health,

asr-000011
01:12:32.090 --> 01:12:38.830
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: subject to its resumption on Monday at a time to be determined by the Chairperson of the Committee on Appropriations.

asr-000012
01:12:39.130 --> 01:12:40.190
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I so move, Mr. Chair.

asr-000013
01:12:41.870 --> 01:12:49.670
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: It has been moved and duly seconded to suspend consideration of the proposed budget of the DOH

asr-000014
01:12:49.770 --> 01:12:57.530
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: subject to its resumption on Monday, September 7, at a time to be determined by the Chair.

asr-000015
01:12:57.530 --> 01:13:04.790
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Is there any objection? Hearing none, the motion is approved.

asr-000016
01:13:16.110 --> 01:13:31.940
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Mr. Chair?

asr-000017
01:13:33.080 --> 01:13:35.300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Cong [unclear], please proceed.

asr-000017-split-2
01:13:35.300 --> 01:13:49.600
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: I move that we suspend the committee hearing here at the Ramualdez Hall on House Bill No. 10858 until tomorrow, September 3, 2026, at 9 a.m.

asr-000018
01:13:49.640 --> 01:13:51.080
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: I so move, Mr. Chair.

asr-000019
01:13:52.180 --> 01:13:53.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Second, Mr. Chair.

asr-000020
01:13:55.190 --> 01:14:03.750
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: It has been moved and duly seconded. Is there any objection? Hearing none, the Chair, the Committee.

asr-000021
01:14:04.430 --> 01:14:17.010
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Hearing on House Bill No. 10858 here at the Ramualdez Hall is hereby suspended until tomorrow, 9 a.m.

asr-000022
01:14:19.970 --> 01:14:21.770
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Until tomorrow, 9 a.m.

